</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-NAVI-022" data-name="纵向步骤条" data-cat="NAVI">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">纵向步骤条</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：订单进度与售后流程按先后竖排，标出当前步</p>
